; Restricted work data. Implementation and acceptance are distinct; the roadmap is generated.
;
; WHAT :done MEANS HERE, ruled by Glenn Fiedler on 2026-09-19:
;   "done means everything is tested and verified working. not done until tested."
; A task is :done only when every clause of its own title has a test that proves
; it, and the test is named in :evidence by file and function. A clause that is
; unproved, unobservable or merely argued keeps the task :unknown, with that
; clause named in the task's :note.
(:schema 1 :root "schema/fixed-tables-goal"
 :page (:title "Schema roadmap"
        :roadmaps ("packet-wire" "fixed-tables" "variable-tables")
        :closing ((:title "Fund this work" :text ("Schema is built by Glenn Fiedler, together with AI collaborators that do much of the building, testing and porting. Glenn owns every design decision. Every month a [public ledger](https://github.com/mas-bandwidth/patreon#public-ledgers) shows where the AI collaborator's tokens went, by repository, and what they bought." "If you'd like to support this work, you can **[become a supporter](https://www.patreon.com/MasBandwidth/membership)**")))) :inventory-status
 "Ordinary capabilities source-reconciled at e3e88a46; 27 named-form refusal leaves reconciled at e4b9147f; remaining original audit obligations still open"
 :source-audit "https://github.com/mas-bandwidth/schema/issues/898#issuecomment-5647865348" :scope-note
 "Only NEW Fixed Tables is active here. Existing acceptance gates remain; Future work is outside these language denominators. Grouping is not a waiver of any underlying requirement."
 :historical-aliases
